{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1232776-3e-dragonblooded-ero-charms","id":1232776,"title":"3e Dragonblooded Ero charms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-07-05T19:23:58-07:00","id":1232776,"title":"3e Dragonblooded Ero charms","content":"Vance said that he would rather not write Dragonblooded Ero charms.<br /> <br /> I'm not Vance.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:26px\">Resistance</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">GRAND JADE PILLAR</span><br /> <b>Cost</b>: -\u037e <b>Mins</b>\u200b: Resistance 2 Essence 1\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Permanent<br /> <b>Keywords</b>\u200b: Balanced, Earth<br /> <b>Duration\u200b:</b> Permanent<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: Untiring Earth Meditation<br /> <br /> A pillar of Jade forever remains standing tall and inviolate. This charm enhances its prerequisite, which upon activation allows the Dragonblooded to last (Resistance) times long when it comes to any sexual activity. If using this charm for sexual activity only then the character does not need to be resisting on stone or earth.<br /> <br /> At Essence 2+ this charm extends to any strenuous activity, allowing a Dragonblooded to work from dusk to dawn without breaking a sweat. Mechanically this means rather than ignoring fatigue penalties, they never occur in the first place.<br /> <br /> Female Dragonblooded learn a different version of this charm called \u201cChasms of the Earth\u201d. The function is identical.<br /> <br /> <b><span style=\"font-size:26px\">Performance (Sex)</span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">TWISTING IVY ENTANGLEMENT</span><br /> <b>Cost\u200b</b>: 1m\u037e <b>Mins\u200b</b>: Performance 1/War 1 Essence 1\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Reflexive<br /> <b>Keywords\u200b</b>: Balanced, Earth/Wood<br /> <b>Duration\u200b</b>: One Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: None<br /> <br /> When the two worlds of the Lover\u2019s collide they merge themselves together like plants intertwining, both in body and souls. Upon activation of this charm the Dragonblooded may designate one person they are in immediate contact with, preventing anima flux from harming them. In a more narrative approach it also prevents the shredding/incineration of bed sheets, the vaporization of water, and other minor effects.<br /> <br /> Another charm exists in War called the Twin Peaks Stand Tall, granting the same effects. This is mainly useful for when Dragonblooded work closely with an ally that isn\u2019t immune to anima flux. It does not lead into War based sex charms, unless you count Gateway voyeurists.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">PHANTOM LOVERS TOUCH</span><br /> <b>Cost\u200b</b>: 5m 1WP\u037e <b>Mins\u200b</b>: Performance 4 Essence 2\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Simple<br /> <b>Keywords\u200b</b>: Air<br /> <b>Duration\u200b</b>: One Scene<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: Invisible Street Performer Technique<br /> <br /> The Lover\u2019s touch is as light as her words. This charm may be activated upon a sexual encounter which leaves the target satisfied, allowing the Dragonblooded to roll (Manipulation + Performance) against the target\u2019s Resolve. If successful the encounter leaves the target dazed by the experience they just had. For up to an hour after coitus the target counts as being unaware of the Dragonblooded\u2019s presence for the purposes of making making Read Intention checks or for the purposes of determining a surprise attack.<br /> <br /> If the Dragonblooded fails a Read Intentions roll then the target is seen snapping back to reality, but the words the Dragonblooded said to them are as fleeting as a dream, allowing the Dragonblooded to still make normal Read Intentions rolls against the target.<br /> <br /> This charm may also be activated against a target after they see the Dragonblooded do something particularly impressive. A target being so blown away by the performance that his mind is nothing but air.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">THE BRIGHTEST CANDLE</span><br /> <b>Cost\u200b</b>: 3m 1WP; <b>Mins\u200b</b>: Performance 5 Essence 2\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Simple<br /> <b>Keywords\u200b</b>: Fire<br /> <b>Duration\u200b</b>: Instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: Soul-Stirring Performance<br /> <br /> The candle that burns the brightest burns the hottest, and the children of Heiesh are more than willing to take that to heart. This charm is a special Inspire roll to make the target feel passionate about something. It could be used to stroke the fires of lust, but can be used to fan the embers of a group of soldiers into a roaring inferno before a battle. If this Inspire attempt succeeds then the Dragonblooded counts herself as having an additional point of appearance to the target. This additional point of appearance lasts for the rest of the scene.<br /> <br /> If this charm is used at Essence 3+ on a target who has a defining positive intimacy towards the Dragonblooded then the Dragonblooded has +1 APP at all times.<br /> <br /> <br /> This charm may be activated alongside its prerequisite while in Fire aura, counting itself as a supplemental charm costing 3m 0WP.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">ALL-CONSUMING PASSION INFERNO</span><br /> <b>Cost\u200b</b>: 5m; <b>Mins\u200b</b>: Performance 5 Essence 3\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Simple<br /> <b>Keywords</b>\u200b: Fire, Psyche<br /> <b>Duration</b>\u200b: Instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: The Brightest Candle<br /> <br /> The fires of passion can make one forget all but the closest things they hold to their hearts. This charm is a special social influence attack that can only be used against a target while in the throes of some sort of strong passion (as mentioned in The Brightest Candle), targeting a single intimacy they are aware of at the Major or lower level. This is a roll of (Charisma/Manipulation + Performance) vs the target\u2019s Resolve which cannot be raised or lowered by intimacies. If successful the target becomes so consumed by that passion that they forget that intimacy even exists, making it ineligible for any social influence effect good or bad. The intimacy is effectively exorcised until the rest of an evening or until after a fateful encounter, with the regret possibly coming in after.<br /> <br /> Note this this must target an intimacy the Dragonblooded is aware of. A player cannot \u201ctake a shot in the dark\u201d with this charm.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">FLOWING CURRENTS SEDUCTION</span><br /> <b>Cost\u200b</b>: 3m; <b>Mins\u200b</b>: Performance 4 Essence 2\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Supplemental<br /> <b>Keywords\u200b</b>: Water<br /> <b>Duration\u200b</b>: Instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: Talented Improvisation<br /> <br /> The children of Danna are capable of weaving both conversation and seduction effortlessly with every action they take, luring people those who pay them heed deeper into their depths. Using this charm the Dragonblooded infuses each and every one of his words and actions with subtle overtones, allowing them to flurry one erotic social influence action similar to the Solar charm Thousand Courtesan Ways.<br /> <br /> If the Dragonblooded is in Water aura then this charm may last as long as the Dragonblooded remains in water aura.<br /> <br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:18px\">SEEDS OF THE WHITE FLOWER</span><br /> <b>Cost\u200b</b>: 10m 1WP; <b>Mins\u200b</b>: Performance 5 Essence 3\u037e <b>Type</b>:\u200b Supplemental<br /> <b>Keywords\u200b</b>: Psyche, Signature (Wood)<br /> <b>Duration\u200b</b>: Instant<br /> <b>Prerequisite charms</b>\u200b: None<br /> <br /> The Dragonblooded carefully plants the seeds of love into another, showing either a beautiful and pure lily or a poisonous devil\u2019s weed depending on their intentions. This charm is a special instill action that may only be activated on a target after a sexual encounter, which if successful implants a minor intimacy towards the Dragonblooded in some romantic way, be it lust or love. What is special about this intimacy is how fast the bonds of love can grow when tended to. An individual finds themselves caring more and more for the Dragonblooded the more time they spend together. So long as the Dragonblooded does nothing to betray the target\u2019s trust, the intimacy grows to a major one after (10 - Essence) days and into defining after (10 - Essence weeks).<br /> <br /> A gardener needs to tend to her garden however. Failure to interact with the target for (Dragonblooded\u2019s Essence) weeks means all time spend nurturing the next bond vanishes and the intimacy is lowered by one step. Once the intimacy reaches defining it remains a beautiful flower, remaining forever lest the jealousy of others stamp it out.<br /> <br /> This charm may only be used once per day. In the event of a \u2018Cynis party\u2019 the character may only use this charm on one character present.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">Notice: If you posting on 4chan and you mention that you are using this material, then you are hereby obligated to share details of how it was used.</span><br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Read my shit at my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/271207-sandact6-homebrew-topic\" target=\"_blank\">homebrew</a> topic, 2.5e and 3e material!<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1263020-alchemicals-2-0-3e-conversion-charm-design-request\" target=\"_blank\">Play Alchemical's in 3e now</a>, you're welcome.","edited":{"userid":1183,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1183-sandact6","user":"Sandact6","date":".  A little light trolling 05-20-2024, 03:57 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"ht